<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty flat vs dlr at 2.8150.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty flat vs dlr at 2.8150.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty flat at 2.8150 against the dollar, and at 1.8395 against the mark, up from Friday's 1.8405, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
